WEBVTT

00:08.500 --> 00:10.790
You'll be safe, too, Keitaro.

00:12.210 --> 00:14.500
Yayoi-chan, what...?

00:15.250 --> 00:16.330
So please...

00:18.080 --> 00:20.750
Gimme your nails.

00:22.500 --> 00:25.000
What the hell does that mean?!

02:01.130 --> 02:06.420
I ended up leaving without asking
any more questions last night.

02:08.210 --> 02:11.750
If I had the choice, I'd never come back here, but...

02:11.880 --> 02:15.830
<b>HOZUKI</b>

02:12.040 --> 02:14.630
I owe Eiko my life... So I have to.

02:15.210 --> 02:17.250
I need to make sure she's okay.

02:18.880 --> 02:21.290
Kei-kun, come on in!

02:23.880 --> 02:26.000
Everything seems fine?

02:30.000 --> 02:31.420
Look, Kei-kun.

02:32.250 --> 02:38.330
I know I said this before, but Yayoi-chan moved in a
year and a half ago, and everything's been perfectly fine.

02:38.670 --> 02:40.080
There's nothing to worry about.

02:40.960 --> 02:42.130
That can't be true.

02:42.210 --> 02:43.710
It's true, I promise!

02:44.040 --> 02:47.670
No way. Even if it is true,
there's got to be something going on here.

02:47.670 --> 02:48.540
But what?

02:49.960 --> 02:53.000
Keitaro, Keitaro. Gimme your nails, pretty-please.

02:55.040 --> 02:55.750
I don't think so!

02:55.750 --> 02:57.330
Oh dear, again?

02:55.750 --> 02:58.250
Gimme your nails.

02:58.710 --> 03:01.460
NOT GONNA HAPPEN!

03:08.500 --> 03:09.710
Personal space, please!

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:09.880 --> 03:11.540
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:10.170 --> 03:11.500
And hello? Creepy!

03:11.540 --> 03:13.080
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:11.540 --> 03:13.080
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:11.540 --> 03:13.080
<b>Can I have your fingernails?</b>

03:11.830 --> 03:12.710
No, thank you!

03:13.420 --> 03:14.330
Keitaro.

03:14.330 --> 03:14.960
Nope!

03:15.210 --> 03:17.960
Just a little's fine. Just a little off the tip!

03:19.710 --> 03:22.460
O-okay! Why don't we go out for a bit of fun?

03:21.210 --> 03:28.920
<b>TOKYO</b>

03:21.210 --> 03:28.920
<b>Tourism Guide</b>

03:22.540 --> 03:25.500
I know somewhere haunt-
uh, a cool touristy spot we could check out!

03:25.500 --> 03:27.960
Don't think I didn't hear what you were just saying!

03:28.130 --> 03:28.920
Spill the deets.

03:29.580 --> 03:30.750
Whisper, whisper...

03:31.040 --> 03:31.830
I like it.

03:31.830 --> 03:32.790
I knew you would!

03:33.040 --> 03:34.790
And I'm sure you'll like it, too!

03:35.080 --> 03:36.290
Don't drag me into this!

03:36.630 --> 03:39.130
C'mon, less talking, more moving!

03:36.920 --> 03:39.880
U-um... h-hello?!

03:41.040 --> 03:42.380
Let's goooo...

03:42.380 --> 03:43.830
...st- wait, he's not here!

03:44.080 --> 03:44.710
See ya.

03:44.880 --> 03:45.880
Kei-kun!

03:46.540 --> 03:48.540
H-hold on!

03:49.790 --> 03:51.170
Keitaro, you scaredy-cat.

03:54.500 --> 03:55.630
You know it.

03:56.750 --> 03:59.710
Why the hell would I want to go with you?

04:00.960 --> 04:07.330
It's scary, and dangerous, and I messed with the
supernatural before and got cursed for the rest of my life!

04:07.670 --> 04:09.250
I even dragged my best friend into it!

04:09.630 --> 04:13.880
The thought of doing that again
makes me so scared I can't stand still!

04:14.130 --> 04:15.920
Is it so wrong I want nothing to do with it?!

04:18.290 --> 04:20.080
You don't like scary stuff?

04:20.920 --> 04:22.460
Didn't I tell you that?

04:22.960 --> 04:24.960
Your curse is a problem?

04:25.670 --> 04:28.210
I'd get rid of it if I could.

04:29.130 --> 04:31.080
I don't even get why you're going, Eiko.

04:33.460 --> 04:35.960
Okay. We'll go on our own.

04:36.880 --> 04:38.290
Hit it, Eiko.

04:38.290 --> 04:40.170
Huh? Are you sure?

04:40.500 --> 04:41.250
Yep.

04:50.170 --> 04:51.500
Why should I care?!

04:53.290 --> 04:57.250
I kinda feel bad. We shouldn't have just left him behind...

04:57.670 --> 05:01.830
I thought Keitaro liked supernatural stuff just like me.

05:02.130 --> 05:02.830
Huh?

05:03.630 --> 05:07.130
'Cause he could get rid of
the curse on his hand if he wanted.

05:07.380 --> 05:09.330
I thought he was keeping it
as a lucky charm or something.

05:09.330 --> 05:11.500
Y-you can get rid of the curse?!

05:12.540 --> 05:16.670
Wait, you both thought you could never get rid of it?

05:16.670 --> 05:18.080
Well, yeah...

05:18.540 --> 05:21.380
Eiko, I know a place we can go.

05:22.250 --> 05:24.420
Where we can find something to get rid of his curse.

05:25.580 --> 05:27.210
The curse is bothering Keitaro.

05:27.750 --> 05:30.880
And Keitaro's not just a tutor to me anymore.

05:34.630 --> 05:37.710
Okay, let's go!

05:43.790 --> 05:47.380
Kei-chan, you should work on your stamina.

05:47.630 --> 05:51.670
A healthy body is harder for spirits to curse.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.500
We'll go on our own.

05:55.710 --> 05:56.710
Dammit!

05:56.750 --> 05:59.170
<b>Home Goods & Improvement Store</b>

06:03.960 --> 06:07.000
I could go buy something for our next session...

06:09.830 --> 06:15.460
We're going to an abandoned temple in West H City
dedicated to babies who died before they were born.

06:16.210 --> 06:21.330
On the site are hundreds of jizo statues
for the children watched over by a maternal figure.

06:21.960 --> 06:24.920
Stories say the ghosts of the unborn haunt the grounds,

06:24.920 --> 06:29.750
and Kishimojin, goddess of children
and childbirth, seeks their revenge...

06:30.250 --> 06:35.460
<b>HAUNTED LOCATION</b>

06:30.250 --> 06:35.460
<b>GUIDEBOOK</b>

06:30.500 --> 06:35.170
It's been on my radar for a while,
but I forgot about it until I saw it in your magazine.

06:35.710 --> 06:36.920
Is that right?

06:42.920 --> 06:43.790
I feel it.

06:58.790 --> 07:01.710
Eiko, I'm going in alone.

07:01.710 --> 07:04.750
Huh? No, I can't let you do that.

07:04.750 --> 07:06.580
Do not leave the car, Eiko.

07:08.130 --> 07:11.000
Is it that scary?

07:11.170 --> 07:11.830
Yup.

07:12.170 --> 07:17.210
If I don't come back in the next hour,
I need you to call for help.

07:26.710 --> 07:28.880
I saw four or five of them on my way here.

07:29.670 --> 07:34.830
If I've seen that many already,
given I usually only see a third of what's out there...

07:35.420 --> 07:38.880
There must be three times more lurking about.

07:58.830 --> 07:59.920
Kishimojin...

08:00.290 --> 08:02.960
Once an evil goddess who devoured children,

08:03.330 --> 08:05.710
when the Buddha spirited away one of her own children,

08:05.920 --> 08:10.630
she learned how it felt to lose a child,
so she stopped eating children...

08:10.960 --> 08:13.170
...and devoted herself to protecting them.

08:17.290 --> 08:19.920
She is always seen surrounded
by the souls of the unborn.

08:20.750 --> 08:25.920
Maybe their inability to rest in peace...
has poisoned her good will.

08:27.710 --> 08:31.420
It's just as I thought, and she's got loads of minions.

08:31.670 --> 08:35.330
I'm not prepared for this. But I can't back down now.

08:36.290 --> 08:37.580
Wait till you see this, Keitaro.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.210
Today, I'm taking out a goddess.

08:42.540 --> 08:43.420
What the...?

08:43.750 --> 08:44.880
An umbilical cord?!

08:46.540 --> 08:49.580
A jizo statue?! But there wasn't one here
just a second ago...

08:49.830 --> 08:54.630
Come hither, sweet child.

09:13.750 --> 09:15.040
Yayoi-chan...

09:16.330 --> 09:18.130
It's been over an hour.

09:40.630 --> 09:41.830
That was a close one...

09:46.170 --> 09:49.830
If I'd been any slower,
I would've gotten way worse than a sprain.

09:53.500 --> 09:57.210
An illusion... made this ivy look like an umbilical cord.

10:01.790 --> 10:02.710
Paper dolls.

10:03.380 --> 10:05.250
Adding a piece of myself...

10:06.880 --> 10:08.500
...lets it serve as my proxy.

10:09.290 --> 10:13.880
It's kind of like having lives in a video game
that shows how many times you can die.

10:15.250 --> 10:17.960
They also make good decoys.

10:23.290 --> 10:24.630
Good timing.

10:25.630 --> 10:27.880
<b>Office Supplies</b>

10:28.130 --> 10:30.040
Scented pens?

10:30.670 --> 10:32.250
Wonder if Yayoi-chan would like one.

10:33.580 --> 10:35.630
Hold on, what am I thinking?

10:35.830 --> 10:36.630
Kei-kun!

10:38.500 --> 10:39.330
Eiko?!

10:40.170 --> 10:44.130
Wh-what's wrong? Wait, how did you know where I was?

10:44.130 --> 10:46.170
Doesn't matter! Yayoi needs help!

10:47.670 --> 10:49.000
Help with what?

10:49.830 --> 10:52.330
I thought you two were going somewhere haunt-

10:52.330 --> 10:54.710
She went by herself and hasn't come back!

10:55.790 --> 10:58.250
O-okay, and?

10:58.830 --> 11:00.580
She got herself into that mess.

11:01.040 --> 11:04.670
Weren't you supposed to be with her?
How'd you let that happen?

11:08.710 --> 11:12.500
Yayoi-chan went in there to find something
that could lift your curse.

11:13.330 --> 11:14.130
That's how.

11:15.210 --> 11:17.710
Lift my curse?

11:17.960 --> 11:21.670
She knew how much your hand
was bothering you and wanted to help.

11:22.420 --> 11:24.630
She'd do that for me?

11:31.960 --> 11:32.750
Eiko!

11:52.750 --> 11:55.290
Come hither...

11:57.500 --> 11:59.330
I caught one of your unborn.

12:00.630 --> 12:01.960
I'll hurt it.

12:02.750 --> 12:07.750
You choose if it lives or dies.

13:13.540 --> 13:17.170
The spirits all just... went away?

13:26.330 --> 13:30.380
Yayoi-chan's gonna be in the creepiest part of this place!

13:30.710 --> 13:32.210
I know that for a fact!

13:43.670 --> 13:45.670
Yayoi-chan!

13:46.420 --> 13:47.420
Keitaro?

13:54.920 --> 13:56.040
Look at him go.

13:57.500 --> 13:58.330
Yayoi-chan!

13:59.500 --> 14:01.210
Wait... she's limping!

14:02.580 --> 14:15.130
<b>EXIT</b>

14:03.460 --> 14:05.920
I've gotta bait as many spirits as I can,

14:05.920 --> 14:07.630
then get them away from Yayoi-chan!

14:08.290 --> 14:10.460
Once they're all chasing me, and the coast is clear,

14:10.460 --> 14:14.210
I'll grab Yayoi-chan and get the hell outta here!

14:16.000 --> 14:18.710
Good thing I've got stamina!

14:19.880 --> 14:20.920
Okay.

14:23.080 --> 14:24.250
I'm not gonna let him show me up.

14:35.420 --> 14:36.330
Yayoi-chan!

14:39.750 --> 14:40.630
Keitaro!

14:53.380 --> 14:54.210
Get in!

15:08.710 --> 15:12.670
<b>Hamasaki Hospital</b>

15:08.710 --> 15:12.670
<b>Hamasaki Hospital</b>

15:09.500 --> 15:12.420
That'll be 14,500 yen for today's check-up.

15:15.460 --> 15:17.630
Sorry, could you cover the bill?!

15:18.330 --> 15:20.670
<b>Car Repair</b>

15:18.330 --> 15:20.670
<b>(Bumper Damage)</b>

15:19.250 --> 15:20.670
<b>Yayoi's Sprain</b>

15:19.250 --> 15:20.670
<b>(No insurance card)</b>

15:21.130 --> 15:22.540
My poor wallet...

15:25.130 --> 15:28.460
Sheesh... You got in over your head again, Yayoi-chan.

15:28.830 --> 15:31.170
I did pretty well on my own.

15:31.170 --> 15:33.880
Until you didn't. And that's before the hospital bill.

15:36.920 --> 15:40.000
Yayoi-chan, Eiko told me everything.

15:40.790 --> 15:43.170
How you went in there to try to help me.

15:45.920 --> 15:46.830
Thank you.

15:47.460 --> 15:50.170
I'm really glad you're okay.

16:01.880 --> 16:05.170
I still don't get why you'd take such a risk
all by yourself, though.

16:05.670 --> 16:06.750
Back then...

16:07.460 --> 16:09.630
...if I could've endured the pain...

16:10.670 --> 16:13.580
...if I'd been strong enough to move...

16:14.540 --> 16:17.250
I might've been able to save my Mommy.

16:19.420 --> 16:24.080
My friends are just as important to me as family.

16:25.460 --> 16:27.170
The curse is bothering Keitaro.

16:27.710 --> 16:30.000
And Keitaro's not just a tutor to me anymore.

16:31.380 --> 16:32.460
He's my friend.

16:33.540 --> 16:35.290
When a friend of mine's in trouble,

16:35.630 --> 16:39.170
I... gotta help them.

16:45.000 --> 16:46.210
Yayoi-chan...

16:47.670 --> 16:51.630
I'll tell you why I need your nails.

16:52.630 --> 16:56.000
Could you come see my room again?

16:57.830 --> 17:01.460
Trust me, Keitaro.

17:03.750 --> 17:06.210
Okay. I trust you.

17:09.920 --> 17:13.040
Keitaro, you know what paper dolls are?

17:13.040 --> 17:15.290
Huh? Uh...

17:15.670 --> 17:20.330
They're like little figures that take on misfortune
to protect you, right?

17:19.750 --> 17:21.080
<b>Yayoi</b>

17:20.920 --> 17:28.170
Basically. To make one, you need to give it
a part of your physical body.

17:29.880 --> 17:32.830
<b>Yayoi</b>

17:30.130 --> 17:32.500
That's how I make this all work.

17:38.670 --> 17:40.540
Some of them are busted up...

17:41.250 --> 17:45.580
Every one of the plushies in this room
has a piece of me inside of them.

17:46.790 --> 17:48.830
They don't need to be made out of paper.

17:49.130 --> 17:54.540
As long as I put a piece of my nails
or a bit of my blood in these possessed plushies,

17:55.000 --> 17:58.420
they'll become my proxies,
and anything attacking me hurts these guys instead.

17:59.920 --> 18:05.500
So if any of them try to hurt me, they all take damage.

18:03.080 --> 18:04.710
<b>ATTACK</b>

18:04.710 --> 18:07.000
<b>Proxies take damage</b>

18:07.000 --> 18:07.880
<b>Unscathed</b>

18:08.040 --> 18:09.750
Even if they tried to sacrifice themselves to get to me,

18:09.750 --> 18:11.670
the other spirits would stop them to protect themselves.

18:09.880 --> 18:15.380
<b>ATTACK</b>

18:12.040 --> 18:13.500
This way, they keep each other in check,

18:13.130 --> 18:15.380
<b>B and C stop</b>

18:13.500 --> 18:15.420
and they'll never attack me.

18:17.790 --> 18:23.540
I've done this for everyone in the Hozuki family.
That's why they're safe.

18:25.040 --> 18:27.670
I can't believe she's come up with all this...

18:28.250 --> 18:30.420
So that's why you wanted my fingernails.

18:30.420 --> 18:34.420
You were telling the truth all along.
You wanted to protect me.

18:35.380 --> 18:36.750
It's a lot of work.

18:37.580 --> 18:44.420
I only show people my collection if I trust them,
to prove I'll always be their friend.

18:45.130 --> 18:47.040
I had no idea...

18:51.460 --> 18:52.580
What'd you just throw in?

18:53.210 --> 18:56.130
The finger from the statue in that shrine.

18:56.830 --> 19:00.830
The beat-up plushies are spirits
who couldn't endure her attacks today.

19:02.040 --> 19:05.710
But the ones who survived must be pretty angry.

19:06.710 --> 19:08.710
Hey, guys, that's her.

19:08.920 --> 19:10.920
It doesn't have a piece in me in it, either.

19:25.330 --> 19:29.250
Want a nail? It'll make it so they can't attack you.

19:35.630 --> 19:37.790
<b>GIVE IT</b>

19:36.960 --> 19:40.790
Bad ghost. Look at me and beg.

19:44.420 --> 19:46.630
<b>PLEASE HELP ME</b>

19:47.540 --> 19:49.080
And don't stain the floor.

19:49.500 --> 19:49.960
<b>PLEASE HELP ME</b>

19:53.710 --> 19:57.000
Caught me the finger of a goddess.

19:57.920 --> 20:02.580
She made it beg for a fingernail.
She showed it who's in charge.

20:03.080 --> 20:07.670
S..so, Yayoi-chan, why are you
collecting all these spirits?

20:08.750 --> 20:11.130
The spirit that took my Mommy was really powerful.

20:11.670 --> 20:14.080
I'll need an army to get her back.

20:14.500 --> 20:16.540
So I'm catching spirits and training them.

20:17.210 --> 20:20.000
My enemy is a monster who won't listen to reason.

20:20.540 --> 20:23.830
So my collection will serve to empower me.

20:24.580 --> 20:30.710
To engrave upon my soul the willingness
to do anything to win, be it good or evil.

20:33.420 --> 20:35.420
I had to give up today 'cause I got hurt.

20:35.830 --> 20:41.000
But if I can get the whole thing back here,
I might be able to get rid of your curse.

20:41.630 --> 20:44.130
I'll try again once my ankle's better.

20:44.330 --> 20:49.790
Yayoi-chan, you're making it sound like
you can make one spirit kill another.

20:49.790 --> 20:51.960
That's 'cause you can. That's how it works.

20:52.880 --> 20:54.830
That's why I went to capture the goddess,

20:55.380 --> 20:59.420
to get her to kill the spirit that attacked you
and lift the curse.

21:01.250 --> 21:05.460
I thought I'd have to live the rest of my life with this curse.

21:06.580 --> 21:10.460
But if we get another spirit to kill the one cursing me...

21:12.040 --> 21:13.500
...I might not have to?

21:13.790 --> 21:17.460
Does that mean... there's hope for us after all?

21:18.920 --> 21:24.250
Both for me... and the person
who got cursed alongside me.

21:26.880 --> 21:27.630
Eiko.

21:30.250 --> 21:35.830
Keitaro, we might want different things,
but we both need the same solution.

21:37.130 --> 21:41.710
So let's go catch some scary spirits
and get them to kill some really bad ones.

21:44.960 --> 21:45.880
Together.

23:21.500 --> 23:25.920
Keitaro has a choice: step away
from the supernatural and live a normal life,

23:27.080 --> 23:30.790
or dive deep into the world of the occult.

23:32.000 --> 23:39.210
He's waited long to enjoy life as a college student-
with a certain smile by his side.
